{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"ICS2 Stop-Words Checker"},"description":"Check a goods description against the official EU ICS2 stop-words list \u2014 terms too vague or generic for an entry summary declaration (ENS) goods description. A standalone stop-word means automatic rejection, an embedded one means make the description more specific; clean=true means no listed term matched, not that it will be accepted. The Commission's whitelist of accepted goods descriptions (ICS2 Common Repository, from 17 November 2026) is applied first: a whole description that is a whitelist entry is not flagged, even when it contains a stop-word, and the answer carries whitelist_match naming the entry and the stop words it contains. For commodity codes use hs_code_lookup; for duty/VAT uk_duty_calculator. Rate-limited: a limit error carries reset_at, the UTC time the allowance resets. Strictly a reference check \u2014 not an ENS filing, not a customs-compliance determination, not legal advice.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"description":"The goods description to check.","type":"string"}},"required":["description"],"type":"object"},"name":"ics2_check","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"_source":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"authority_current_edition":{"type":"string"},"checked":{"type":"string"},"checked_at":{"type":"string"},"dataset_edition":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"provenance_status":{"enum":["verified","pending-verification","computed","live"],"type":"string"},"source_url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","checked","provenance_status"],"type":"object"},"as_of":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"blocking_errors":{"items":{"additionalProper